@startuml
!include style.puml
left to right direction
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 70

actor "Benutzer / Entwickler" as User

package "Digital Twin Gesamtsystem" as DTS {
    component "Python Control Layer\n(mypalletizer API)" as PythonLayer
    component "Unity Simulation Layer\n(Unity 3D / C#)" as UnityLayer
    PythonLayer -[hidden]down- UnityLayer
}

node "MyPalletizer 260 M5\n(Physische Hardware)" as Hardware

User --> PythonLayer : Python-API
PythonLayer --> UnityLayer : UDP / JSON
PythonLayer --> Hardware : USB / Serial

note bottom of DTS
Roboterkanal: Port 5005
Weltkanal: Port 5006
end note

note bottom of Hardware
Hardware-Istwerte über get_angles()
end note

@enduml
